do_3 = "Write interop/crates/layerx-bridge-relayer/src/solana/observe.rs following the program's signatures, keeping only deposits confirmed to the configured slot depth, reading the logged deposit record and its receipt PDA, computing the inbound attestation with the txHash as keccak256 of the 64-byte transaction signature and the logIndex as the receipt's nonce, and refusing a deposit whose logged record and receipt disagree."
