do_5 = "Write interop/crates/layerx-bridge-relayer/tests/solana.rs and its recorded fixture under tests/fixtures covering the configuration's acceptance and each refusal, the attestation computed from a recorded deposit against the pinned vector, the slot-depth refusal, the record-and-receipt disagreement refusal, and a full observe-and-submit cycle with a real signer socket and a real journal on disk in the format tests/loops.rs already uses."
